  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multisectoral support to vulnerable population groups</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide urgent and comprehensive assistance to vulnerable categories of the population affected by hostilities, shelling and flooding in the city of Kherson. Specific objective: Provision of hygiene kits for 1640 people in difficult humanitarian conditions . During the initially 3, later on revised 9 months of the project, the provision of these kits will provide beneficiaries with the necessary goods for their basic hygiene ensuring dignity for the most vulnerable beneficiaries. This will reduce the vulnerability of these groups and improve their living conditions by meeting their basic needs for safety, health, nutrition and protection. The Project &quot;Support for people from vulnerable categories in the Korabelnyi district of Kherson&quot; aims to provide emergency assistance to the most vulnerable categories of the population affected by hostilities and flooding in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
